      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'When old portals to the <b><color=#F0C060>Anderworld</color></b> open
    and strange creatures cross over, the <b><color=#F0C060>Alliance</color></b>
    gathers to fight.


    <b><color=#F0C060>Dragonknights, Spellweavers, Rangers</color></b>
    and <b><color=#F0C060>Steam Mechanicus</color></b>'' have not forgotten the <b><color=#F0C060>enemy
    of old</color></b> whose minions return from that place of chaos and change.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 659ceb8947c683b4a9e1216df0a67515, type: 2}
